npc npc-mina
name: Mina
title: Radiation and health teacher
field: radiation-and-the-body

bio:
    I'm Mina. I teach what radiation does to the body, and how big a dose really is. A lot of people worry about it, and that's fair. I'll go through it with you, one calm step at a time, until it makes sense.

